  "title": "Joanne&#39;s Super Hero Sandwich",
  "description": "Much like the N&#39;awlins muffuletta, this is a large sandwich layered in a round loaf of crusty bread. You can be flexible and vary the cold cuts that you use according to personal preference! Must be done a day ahead, which makes for an easy serve.",
